      "content": "i mean, u said it's \"undeniably true\" that the system has those issues, but that's kind of a soft way to put it. if the media is actively manipulating people and the govt is corrupt, isn't it more than just \"disenfranchisement\"? it sounds like the movement is actually exposing the actual reality of how things work behind the scenes. don't you think the \"good vs evil\" thing is just an accurate description of what's actually happening?",
